{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The year is 2057, following a second mass quarantine. Headlines are ablaze with talks of the dawn of the Second Missile Crisis. The internet is inundated with mass-produced content and information. <br>With the looming risk of escalation, Smiletech has called on you to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916770/extras/ac94acdb5655a78b70b892c52ad92b10.avif?t=1754320756\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cut through hordes of Monstroda's mechanical Armada Detail with nothing less than swift reflexes and untouchable movement. <br>As you learn, so will they. Long killstreaks will summon greater numbers of stronger enemies. Androids wisen up to explosives and dodge them. Deadly Ordnance is deployed from orbit to stop you, ranging from healing auras to carpet bombs.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916770/extras/25d4435c986ec4c86bd165fb54aa5849.avif?t=1754320756\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rend synthetic flesh apart with a blast of superheated plasma, pop heads with a heavy-caliber handgun, or turn entire crowds into mush with one well-aimed rifle shot.<br>No matter the situation, there is always more than one correct answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916770/extras/814030e05bdef78e35c90a5bfb8683c1.avif?t=1754320756\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through the bitter far reaches of the industrialized North Pole to reach Death's Gulf, Monstroda's HQ to a self-composed soundtrack. Unravel the true nature of the Second Missile Crisis to avert extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916770/extras/d1ad5d6e27a2262e548fa640427c60bd.avif?t=1754320756\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level features at least one variation and secret event depending on difficulty and your Threat Level, ranging from denser encounters to entirely new routes.<br>Challenge yourself, and be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free the internet. Stop Armageddon.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916770?t=1754320756","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916770?t=1754320756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916770/688239dd94ac5cce1213a7800c9c0e2cb1ce4853/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754320756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916770/688239dd94ac5cce1213a7800c9c0e2cb1ce4853/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754320756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"DEADNET primarily depicts detailed, but cartoon violence involving robots which shows limbs, guts, and various parts when gibbing an enemy. Most blood/gore is colored neon blue, but there are parts involving violence against human enemies."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The year is 2057, following a second mass quarantine. Headlines are ablaze with talks of the dawn of the Second Missile Crisis. The internet is inundated with mass-produced content and information. <br>With the looming risk of escalation, Smiletech has called on you to investigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916770/extras/ac94acdb5655a78b70b892c52ad92b10.avif?t=1754320756\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cut through hordes of Monstroda's mechanical Armada Detail with nothing less than swift reflexes and untouchable movement. <br>As you learn, so will they. Long killstreaks will summon greater numbers of stronger enemies. Androids wisen up to explosives and dodge them. Deadly Ordnance is deployed from orbit to stop you, ranging from healing auras to carpet bombs.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916770/extras/25d4435c986ec4c86bd165fb54aa5849.avif?t=1754320756\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rend synthetic flesh apart with a blast of superheated plasma, pop heads with a heavy-caliber handgun, or turn entire crowds into mush with one well-aimed rifle shot.<br>No matter the situation, there is always more than one correct answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916770/extras/814030e05bdef78e35c90a5bfb8683c1.avif?t=1754320756\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle through the bitter far reaches of the industrialized North Pole to reach Death's Gulf, Monstroda's HQ to a self-composed soundtrack. Unravel the true nature of the Second Missile Crisis to avert extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916770/extras/d1ad5d6e27a2262e548fa640427c60bd.avif?t=1754320756\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level features at least one variation and secret event depending on difficulty and your Threat Level, ranging from denser encounters to entirely new routes.<br>Challenge yourself, and be rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free the internet. Stop Armageddon.</p>","developers":["gorecat_dev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916770/252cb335df0c226f0a9258721762598fb0b4f7b6/header.jpg?t=1754320756","